initialMessages.content:
## Available Tools and Delegates

The following callable tools are available through the model tool interface. Use the provider-native tool schema for arguments. Tools whose `kind` is `delegate` start a child run for that delegate profile.

```json
{
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "read_file",
      "kind": "tool",
      "description": "Read the textual content of a file at the given path. Supports optional line or byte ranges. Uses pandoc for supported document and spreadsheet formats."
    },
    {
      "name": "list_directory",
      "kind": "tool",
      "description": "List entries in a directory. Supports pagination with maxEntries and cursor."
    },
    {
      "name": "write_file",
      "kind": "tool",
      "description": "Write text content to a file at the given path, optionally converting Markdown/text content to docx, pptx, or latex with pandoc. Creates parent directories if needed. Requires approval."
    },
    {
      "name": "web_search",
      "kind": "tool",
      "description": "Search the web for current or unknown information. Include a short purpose when possible so the search stays goal-directed. Returns results with title, URL, and snippet."
    },
    {
      "name": "read_web_page",
      "kind": "tool",
      "description": "Fetch a web page and extract its text content. Returns the URL, page title, and extracted text."
    },
    {
      "name": "delegate__70657273697374656e742d636f64652d6578656375746f72",
      "kind": "delegate",
      "description": "Execute multiple related code cells in one persistent E2B sandbox for the duration of a delegated run."
    },
    {
      "name": "delegate__72657365617263686572",
      "kind": "delegate",
      "description": "Research a topic using web search and page reading, then return structured findings"
    },
    {
      "name": "delegate__66696c652d616e616c797374",
      "kind": "delegate",
      "description": "Analyze local files and directories, summarize contents and structure"
    },
    {
      "name": "delegate__617564696f2d616e616c797374",
      "kind": "delegate",
      "description": "Analyze audio files, produce transcripts, extract key information, and return structured results to the parent run."
    }
  ]
}
```

